  "title": "Yellow Citrusy Venezuelan Chicken Skewers",
  "description": "A light and citrusy Venezuelan dish featuring chicken skewers with a chilli and lardon flavor, perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
