  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lime juice, olive oil, chilli flakes, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread the marinated chicken, yellow bell pepper, and onion onto skewers.",
    "Render the lardons in a pan over medium heat until crispy.",
    "Brush the skewers with the rendered lardon fat.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with additional lime juice and chilli flakes if desired."
